{"id":"6a215fa4f19a6a0b","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-productive-function.md","title":"Productive Function","display":"df-productive-function — Productive Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-productive-function","aliases":["88-df-productive-function"],"display":"df-productive-function — Productive Function","depends_on":["[[88-df-ce-set]]","[[88-df-partial-computable]]","[[88-df-defined]]","[[88-df-ce-indexing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-productive-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-productive-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-productive-function — Productive Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b020503ba5d16dce\" href=\"?note=b020503ba5d16dce\" title=\"88-df-partial-computable\">88-df-partial-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7663d6a38dbde5cc\" href=\"?note=7663d6a38dbde5cc\" title=\"88-df-defined\">88-df-defined</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"63bffa02095213d3\" href=\"?note=63bffa02095213d3\" title=\"88-df-ce-indexing\">88-df-ce-indexing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-productive-function-—-Productive-Function-$p$\">df-productive-function — Productive Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (candidate productive set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((W_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (canonical c.e. sets, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\">\\(W_e=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"63bffa02095213d3\" href=\"?note=63bffa02095213d3\" title=\"88-df-ce-indexing\">88-df-ce-indexing</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\\)</span> (unary partial computable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b020503ba5d16dce\" href=\"?note=b020503ba5d16dce\" title=\"88-df-partial-computable\">88-df-partial-computable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(e)\\downarrow\">\\(p(e)\\downarrow\\)</span> (definedness notation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7663d6a38dbde5cc\" href=\"?note=7663d6a38dbde5cc\" title=\"88-df-defined\">88-df-defined</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prod}(p,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prod}(p,A)\\)</span> (productive-function predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}productive\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Prod}(p,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathbb N\n\\land p\\in\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\n\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\nW_e\\subseteq A\n\\to\n(p(e)\\downarrow\\land p(e)\\in A\\setminus W_e)\n\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}productive\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Prod}(p,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathbb N\n\\land p\\in\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\n\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\nW_e\\subseteq A\n\\to\n(p(e)\\downarrow\\land p(e)\\in A\\setminus W_e)\n\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> : 生产力函数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_n\">\\(W_n\\)</span> : 编号<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>的CE集 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"63bffa02095213d3\" href=\"?note=63bffa02095213d3\" title=\"88-df-ce-indexing\">88-df-ce-indexing</a>)</li>\n<li>生产力函数能找到不在子集中的新元素</li>\n<li>创造集的补集具有生产函数</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-productive-function-—-Productive-Function-$p$","text":"df-productive-function — Productive Function $p$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-computable","status":"resolved","id":"b020503ba5d16dce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-partial-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-defined","status":"resolved","id":"7663d6a38dbde5cc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-defined]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-indexing","status":"resolved","id":"63bffa02095213d3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-indexing]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-indexing","status":"resolved","id":"63bffa02095213d3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(W_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$ (canonical c.e. sets, $W_e=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)$, see [[88-df-ce-indexing]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-computable","status":"resolved","id":"b020503ba5d16dce","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p\\in\\mathrm{PartC